<view class="page">
 <view class="heading"><text class="brand">方块A3</text><text class="rules-toggle" bindtap="toggleMusic">{{musicOpen?'收起音乐 −':'音乐 ♪'}}</text><text class="rules-toggle" bindtap="toggleRules">{{rules?'收起规则 −':'玩法规则 ＋'}}</text></view>
 <view wx:if="{{musicOpen}}" class="music-panel"><text class="result-title">方块留声机 · CC0</text><text class="music-title">{{musicTitle}}</text><text>{{musicArtist}} · {{musicStatus}}</text>
 <view class="actions"><button bindtap="previousMusic">上一首</button><button class="primary" bindtap="playMusic">{{musicPlaying?'暂停':'播放'}}</button><button bindtap="nextMusic">下一首</button></view>
 <view class="music-times"><text>{{musicCurrent}}</text><text>{{musicTotal}}</text></view><slider min="0" max="{{musicDuration || 1}}" value="{{musicProgress}}" disabled="{{!musicDuration}}" bindchange="seekMusic" activeColor="#abd082"/>
 <picker mode="selector" range="{{['列表循环','随机播放','单曲循环']}}" value="{{musicMode}}" bindchange="musicMode"><view class="music-mode">播放方式：{{musicMode===0?'列表循环':musicMode===1?'随机播放':'单曲循环'}} ↕</view></picker>
 <view class="music-tracks"><button wx:for="{{musicTracks}}" wx:key="id" data-track="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseMusic" class="{{musicTrackId===item.id?'current':''}}"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.caption}} · {{item.artist}}</text></button></view>
 <text>音乐音量</text><slider min="0" max="100" value="{{musicVolume}}" bindchange="musicVolume" activeColor="#abd082"/>
 <text wx:if="{{musicError}}" class="error">{{musicError}}</text><button wx:if="{{musicError}}" bindtap="retryMusic">重试当前曲目</button><text class="music-credit">预置曲目均为 CC0，作者信息见曲目列表。</text></view>
 <view wx:if="{{!started}}" class="welcome"><text class="eyebrow">好友同桌 · 像素牌局</text><text class="title">四位牌友，即刻开局。</text><text>♠A 与 ♠3 同队 · 双牌单人组队 · ♦4 首出</text></view>
 <view class="table-wrap"><canvas type="webgl" id="table" class="canvas"/><view wx:if="{{!started}}" class="emblem">A · 3</view>
  <view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="seat" class="player seat-{{item.relative}} {{item.active?'active':''}}"><view class="who"><view class="face"><view wx:for="{{item.face}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="*this" class="face-row" style="{{row}}"/></view><text>{{item.name}}</text></view><text class="small">{{item.rank?'第 '+item.rank+' 名':item.count+' 张'}} · {{item.identity}}</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{started}}" class="message table-message">{{message}}</view>
  <view class="trick"><text wx:for="{{last}}" wx:key="text" class="mini-card {{item.red?'red':''}}">{{item.text}}</text></view>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{heldIdentity}}" class="identity-note"><text class="note-label">身份牌提醒</text>你持有 {{heldIdentity}}</view><view wx:if="{{playedIdentity}}" class="identity-note"><text class="note-label">桌面提醒</text>{{playedIdentity}}</view><view wx:if="{{!started}}" class="message">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{room}}" class="room" bindtap="copyRoom">房号 {{room}} · 点击复制</view>
 <view wx:if="{{choiceStage}}" class="choice-panel">
  <text class="result-title">交出牌池 · 双方预选</text><text>你可选 {{choiceQuota}} 张，已选 {{choiceCount}} 张；无冲突才分牌。</text>
  <view class="choice-pool"><button wx:for="{{tributePool}}" wx:key="index" bindtap="chooseTribute" data-index="{{item.index}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}" class="pool-card {{item.red?'red':''}} {{item.picked?'picked':''}} {{item.conflict?'conflict':''}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.from}} 交出</text><text>{{item.owners}}</text></button></view>
  <text wx:if="{{choiceResult}}" class="choice-result">{{choiceResult}}</text>
  <view wx:if="{{choiceDuel}}" class="rps-window"><text class="rps-title">石头 · 剪刀 · 布</text><text>第 {{choiceDuel.round}} 回合 · {{choiceDuel.names}}</text><text class="rps-tip">先手动选手势，再确认出拳</text><view class="rps-options"><button wx:for="{{rpsOptions}}" wx:key="move" class="rps-slot {{item.selected?'chosen':''}}" bindtap="rps" data-move="{{item.move}}" disabled="{{!choiceDuel.canMove}}"><view class="pixel-hand"><view wx:for="{{item.rows}}" wx:for-item="pixelRow" wx:key="index" style="{{pixelRow}}"/></view><text>{{item.label}}</text></button></view><button class="rps-confirm" bindtap="confirmRps" disabled="{{!choiceDuel.canConfirm}}">{{choiceDuel.submitted?'已出拳，等待对方':choiceDuel.draft?'确认出拳':'请先选择手势'}}</button><text>双方确认后才公开手势，不会自动代出。</text></view>
  <view wx:else><button wx:if="{{choiceQuota && !choiceLocked}}" bindtap="confirmChoice" class="primary" disabled="{{!choiceCanConfirm}}">提交预选 {{choiceCount}}/{{choiceQuota}}</button><button wx:for="{{choiceOpponents}}" wx:key="seat" bindtap="startRps" data-seat="{{item.seat}}">与 {{item.name}} 猜拳</button><text wx:if="{{choiceLocked}}">猜拳胜出，你的预选已锁定。</text></view>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{started}}" class="game"><view class="hand-heading"><text>{{identity}} · {{mode}}</text><text>{{choiceStage?'先完成交出牌预选':tributing?'回牌禁选 ♠A、♠3、♦4':'点选手牌后出牌'}}</text></view><view class="hand"><view wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="select" data-id="{{item.id}}" class="card {{item.red?'red':''}} {{item.selected?'selected':''}} {{item.identityCard?'identity-card':''}}"><text>{{item.rankText}}</text><view class="card-suit pixel-suit" aria-label="{{item.suitName}}"><view wx:for="{{item.suitRows}}" wx:for-item="pixelRow" wx:key="index" style="{{pixelRow}}"/></view></view></view><view class="actions"><button hover-class="button-pressed" bindtap="pass" disabled="{{!canPass}}">过牌</button><button hover-class="button-pressed" bindtap="hint" disabled="{{!canHint}}">提示</button><button hover-class="button-pressed" class="primary" bindtap="play" disabled="{{!canPlay}}">{{tributing?'确认回牌':'出牌 ↑'}}</button></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{teammateHands.length}}" class="teammate-panel"><button bindtap="toggleTeammates">{{showTeammates?'收起':'查看'}}队友手牌</button><view wx:if="{{showTeammates}}"><text>你已出完 · 仅可查看本队手牌，实时更新</text><view wx:for="{{teammateHands}}" wx:for-item="teammate" wx:key="seat"><text>{{teammate.name}} · {{teammate.cards.length}} 张</text><view class="observed-hand"><view wx:for="{{teammate.cards}}" wx:key="id" class="observed-card {{item.red?'red':''}}"><text>{{item.rankText}}</text><view class="pixel-suit"><view wx:for="{{item.suitRows}}" wx:for-item="pixelRow" wx:key="index" style="{{pixelRow}}"/></view></view></view></view></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{results.length}}" class="results"><text class="result-title">本局积分</text><view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="name"><text>第 {{item.rank}} 名  · {{item.name}} · {{item.identity}}</text><text>{{item.score>0?'+':''}}{{item.score}} 分</text></view></view>
 <button hover-class="button-pressed" wx:if="{{results.length}}" class="primary" bindtap="nextRound">下一局 · 交牌</button><view class="start-actions"><button hover-class="button-pressed" class="primary" bindtap="practice">{{started?'新开练习':'开始练习 →'}}</button><button hover-class="button-pressed" bindtap="openNetwork">好友开桌</button></view>
 <button hover-class="button-pressed" wx:if="{{resume}}" class="primary" bindtap="resumeRoom">回到牌桌 · 房号 {{resume}}</button>
 <view wx:if="{{network}}" class="network">
  <view wx:if="{{!user}}"><text class="result-title">登录账号 · 多端互通</text><input type="text" value="{{email}}" bindinput="emailInput" placeholder="邮箱"/><input password value="{{password}}" bindinput="passInput" placeholder="密码（至少 8 位）"/><input maxlength="12" value="{{nick}}" bindinput="nickInput" placeholder="昵称（仅注册时需要）"/><view class="start-actions"><button hover-class="button-pressed" class="primary" bindtap="login">登录</button><button hover-class="button-pressed" bindtap="login" data-register="yes">注册</button></view><button hover-class="button-pressed" bindtap="wxLogin">微信一键登录</button></view>
  <view wx:else class="account"><view class="who"><view class="face big"><view wx:for="{{myFace}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="*this" class="face-row" style="{{row}}"/></view><text>{{user.name}} · 积分 {{user.score}} · {{user.wins}}/{{user.games}} 胜</text></view><text class="small" bindtap="logout">退出登录</text></view>
  <button hover-class="button-pressed" wx:if="{{user}}" bindtap="connect" class="primary">创建好友房</button><input wx:if="{{user}}" maxlength="10" value="{{joinCode}}" bindinput="codeInput" placeholder="输入 10 位房号"/><button hover-class="button-pressed" wx:if="{{user}}" bindtap="connect" data-join="yes">加入房间</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>

 <view wx:if="{{rules}}" class="rules"><text class="result-title">玩法规则 · 基础积分</text><text>四人各 13 张。持 ♠A、♠3 的玩家为 A3 阵营；同时持两张则单人组队，其余玩家为普通阵营。身份牌打出才揭示。</text><text>♦4 先出，首手必含 ♦4，逆时针轮转。</text><text>单 / 对 / 三 / 五张。同花顺 ＞ 四带一 ＞ 三带二 ＞ 同花 ＞ 顺子。没有炸弹。</text><text>3 ＞ 2 ＞ A ＞ K … ＞ 4。同点比 ♠ ＞ ♥ ＞ ♣ ＞ ♦。同花比最大牌。顺子为 34567 到 10JQKA，2 不入顺。</text><text>其他在局玩家连续全过，重新领出。出完者下家接续领出；过牌后可再出。报单后能压必须出。</text><text>双人阵营积分：第 1、2 名同队全胜；第 1、3 名同队半胜；第 1、4 名对第 2、3 名平局。每人分别 ±2 / ±1 / 0 分。单人阵营按第 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 名计 +6 / +3 / −3 / −6 分，其余每人对应 −2 / −1 / +1 / +2 分。</text><text>局间换牌 · 交牌：输方自动交出除 ♠A、♠3 外最大的牌。双人阵营全败为双张交牌，每位赢家收两张；半败为单张交牌，每位赢家收一张；平局不换牌。单人阵营全胜／全败每家两张，半胜／半败每家一张。多人收牌时，交出的牌先入同一牌池，每人按份额预选；无冲突才分牌。冲突可改选或发起猜拳，双方出拳后才揭示、平手重来；胜者保留预选，败者从剩余牌重选。</text><text>局间换牌 · 回牌：收牌者逐张选牌，等量回给所选牌的原交牌者，可退回刚收到的牌，禁止回 ♠A、♠3、♦4。不设豁免或抵消换牌。全部回完才按最终手牌确定阵营，由 ♦4 首出。不启用倍数变体。</text></view>
 <view class="footer">四人扑克 · 纯娱乐积分 · 等量换牌</view>
</view>
